        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lillian Harmer, Carrie Nation\n- Works: A Shriek in the Night, The Bowery\n- Topics: supporting roles, historical character portrayal, temperance activism\n\nFacts:\n- In 1933, Lillian Harmer was cast in featured supporting roles in the films \"A Shriek in the Night\" and \"The Bowery.\"\n- In the 1933 film \"The Bowery,\" Lillian Harmer played the historical figure Carrie Nation.\n- Carrie Nation is particularly known for attacking alcohol-serving establishments, especially taverns, with a hatchet.",
